# Run in a nested lit by ../../../roundtrip.test: %{msil_prog} of two sources
# at every level of msil_opt_levels, built by msil-prog.py with the stand-ins
# of ../../prog-cc.py (which read the values below). With --param
# msil_roundtrip=1 the round-trip leg reassembles each level's
# <t>.<L>.d/prog.exe into <t>.<L>.rt.exe and runs it against rt-prog.expected.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && split-file %s %t
# REDEFINE: %{msil_srcs} = %t/main.c %t/util.c
# RUN: %{msil_prog}

